<title>TURKEY: Turkey c.bank reserve down $49 mln last week.</title>
<headline>Turkey c.bank reserve down $49 mln last week.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish central bank said on Thursday its foreign currency reserves fell by $49 million to $17.225 billion in the week to November 8.</p>
<p>Figures in billion dollar</p>
<p>		   November 8     November 1   end-1995</p>
<p> Forex reserve   17.225	  17.274	 12.391</p>
<p> Gold reserve     1.383	   1.383	  1.383</p>
<p> Total reserve   18.608	  18.657	 13.774</p>
<p>Gross international reserves, including gold and commercial bank holdings, fell by $87 million to $27.848 billion in the week ending October 25, the bank said.</p>
<p>--Ankara Newsroom, 90-312-4462940</p>
</text>
